      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "Modifier能扩充字母格、积累Bonus Points，甚至把Q字块直接改造成QU组合块",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Modifiers change the rules of the game, in your favour. Add more tile spaces, build Bonus Points, make Q tiles become QU tiles, and more.",
