      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "整局以有限Plays作为生命资源，耗尽前必须抵达终点，否则所有构筑从头开始",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Can you reach the end of the game without running out of \"Plays\"? Or will you have to start again from scratch?",
